| Test: loads HEVCHW and runs its three safe tests (the clock, the
| registers, memory). RMLoad replaces a copy already loaded. The report
| is also saved as Result.
RMLoad <Obey$Dir>.HEVCHW
Spool <Obey$Dir>.Result
Echo HEVCHW Test
HEVCInfo
Echo HEVCRegTest
HEVCRegTest
Echo HEVCMemTest
HEVCMemTest
Spool
